- CWE-122 (Heap Buffer Overflow) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-20 (Buffer Overflow) - Low Confidence
- CWE-129 (Improper Validation of Array Index) - Low Confidence
- CWE-79 (Improper Neutralization of Input During HTTP-CGI Output) - Medium Confidence

