CWEs: CWE-400 (Uncontrolled Resource Consumption), CWE-119 (Out-of-Bounds Read/Write), CWE-119 (Incorrect Calculation of Buffer Size), CWE-20 (Missing Input Validation), CWE-395 (Resource Leaks), CWE-77 (Insufficient Error Handling), CWE-77 (Incorrect Use of Exception Handling), CWE-19 (Insecure Data Representation), and unspecified CWEs for missing secure coding practices.

