CWEs: CWE-682 (Integer Overflow) - High Confidence, CWE-126 (Buffer Overread) - High Confidence, CWE-257 (Incorrect Implementation of Secure Coding Practices) - Medium Confidence, CWE-20 (Lack of Input Validation) - Low Confidence, CWE-400 (Potential Resource Exhaustion) - Low Confidence

