CWEs:
- CWE-120 (Stack-Based Buffer Overflow) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-120 (Use of strcpy() without buffer size check) - High Confidence
- CWE-200 (Information Exposure Through Publicly Accessible Ports or Interfaces) - Low Confidence
- CWE-562 (Use After Free) - Medium Confidence

Note: The confidence levels provided are based on the analysis conducted and might not fully capture every possible scenario, as the specific context of system operation could significantly influence exploitability.

