4. **Integer overflow**: The function uses `OPJ_UINT32` to represent various counters and indices, which can lead to integer overflows if the values exceed the maximum limit of `OPJ_UINT32`. This could potentially cause buffer overflows or other security issues.

   CWE: [CWE-190](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/190.html) - Integer Overflow
