- CWE-22 (Path Traversal) - High Confidence
- CWE-20 (Improper Input Validation) - High Confidence (for both input validation and unquoted file paths)
- CWE-777 (Missing Authentication for Critical Function) - Low Confidence (due to lack of context on criticality)
</analysis>

