   - Ensuring that this method runs with the least privilege necessary is crucial to mitigate such risks.

Based on these observations, the primary concern is the command injection vulnerability due to direct interpolation of user-controlled input into CLI commands without any sanitization or validation. This issue could allow an attacker to execute arbitrary commands on the underlying system if exploited.

