CWEs: 
- CWE-20 (Improper Input Validation) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-434 (Unrestricted Upload of File with Dangerous Type) - High Confidence
- CWE-352 (Cross-Site Request Forgery) - Low Confidence
- CWE-284 (Improper Access Control) - Medium Confidence
</analysis>

