   - This vulnerability is also highly exploitable due to its direct inclusion of user input into an executable SQL command without any form of parameterization.

The code could be improved by using parameterized queries (or prepared statements) instead of string formatting for constructing SQL commands. Additionally, implementing comprehensive input validation and error handling mechanisms would further enhance the security of this function.
