4. **Arithmetic Operations on Unsigned Data**: The code involves several arithmetic operations on unsigned integers, such as `dff_file_header.ckDataSize + 1 && dff_file_header.ckDataSize + 12 != infilesize`. While these specific operations are unlikely to cause issues due to the nature of the checks, they generally warrant careful handling in C/C++ programming.

