CWEs:
- CWE-120 (Buffer Copy without Checking Size of Input) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-170 (Incorrect Calculation of Buffer Sizes) - Low Confidence, due to lack of complete context about `get_line_size` and underlying buffer handling.

</analysis>

