- CWE-20 (Improper Input Validation) - Medium Confidence: Due to lack of comprehensive validation of input parameters and data from external sources.
- CWE-787 (Out-of-bounds Write) - Low Confidence: Possible boundary checking issues, depending on the context and implementation of dependent functions like `parse_7zip_uint64`.
</analysis>

