- CWE-122 (Stack-based Buffer Overflow): Low Confidence. While there are sanity checks for image dimensions, this depends on the integrity of data from `giflib`. If `giflib` has vulnerabilities that this function does not guard against, it could be susceptible to buffer overflow attacks.
