- CWE-20 (Improper Input Validation) - Low Confidence (some validation present but could be more comprehensive)

Overall, the code appears well-structured for its intended purpose with some minor areas of potential improvement in input handling and error management. The robustness largely hinges on secure implementations of auxiliary functions like `next_field`, `ismode`, etc.
