   - While the code adjusts parameters based on input values (`parameters`, `image`) passed in, there are no explicit user inputs being processed directly here, reducing concerns about direct untrusted input handling vulnerabilities such as SQL injection or cross-site scripting (CWE-79, CWE-434).
