   - The function enforces specific constraints based on cinema profiles (2K or 4K), which might lead to unexpected behavior if incorrect profile values are passed. This can result in logical errors rather than security vulnerabilities per se but could potentially cause misuse if parameters are improperly set by a higher-level component.
