4. **Incorrect exception handling**: The code rethrows an exception after printing a custom message and it would be better to handle this case more carefully, possibly by retrying the operation with exponential backoff or showing a generic error message to the user in a safe way. 

Overall, these findings are medium confidence level but they all point towards potential serious vulnerabilities if not handled properly.
